[00:00.700]I still remember
{"我仍记得"}
[00:02.700]Loving in danger
{"爱在危险边缘"}
[00:04.700]You set me on fire
{"你让我心燃烈焰"}
[00:06.700]When I'm by your side
{"当我在你身边"}
[00:09.700]You taking me higher
{"你带我飞向云端"}
[00:11.700]I follow you down if we go down
{"若坠落我愿随你沉沦"}
[00:14.700]Now you say you wanna get away
{"如今你说想要逃离"}
[00:16.700]You wanna take me all the way
{"你想带我远走高飞"}
[00:19.700]Might get burned if you get closer
{"靠近太阳或许会灼伤"}
[00:22.700]To the sun (I want yah)
{"奔向太阳（我要你）"}
[00:25.700]We can burn together fading into one another
{"我们可以相融燃烧成一体"}
[00:36.700]Ohh!!!Oh don't you know
{"哦！！！哦　难道你不知道"}
[00:37.700]You're still heaven to me
{"你仍是我的天堂"}
[00:39.700]Baby, we could run free
{"宝贝我们可以自由奔逃"}
[00:42.700]If you do it just the way I like
{"若你按我喜欢的方式"}
[00:45.700]Maybe I could waste my time
{"或许我会甘愿虚度时光"}
[00:47.700]On you
{"在你身上"}
[00:48.700]Never mind all our worries
{"别在意所有烦忧"}
